{"version":1,"entries":[{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"セル","summary":"表を構成する1つのマス。「A1」のように列(英字)と行(数字)で場所を表します。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0001"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"セル範囲","summary":"複数のセルのまとまり。A1:C5 のようにコロンで書きます。","examples":[{"code":"=SUM(A1:A5)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0002"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"ワークシート","summary":"ブックの中の1枚の表。タブで切り替えます。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0003"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"ブック","summary":"Excel のファイル全体（.xlsx）。複数のシートを持ちます。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0004"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"数式バー","summary":"選択したセルの内容（数式）を表示・編集する欄。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0005"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"アクティブセル","summary":"現在選択されている（入力される）セル。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0006"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"名前ボックス","summary":"選択範囲の名前を表示し、セルへ移動もできる欄。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0007"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"リボン","summary":"ホーム・挿入などのタブにボタンが並んだ操作領域。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0008"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"テーブル","summary":"範囲をテーブルにすると、並べ替え・フィルター・自動拡張が使えます。Ctrl+T で作成。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0009"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"オートフィル","summary":"セルの右下の■をドラッグして、連続データや数式をコピーする機能。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0010"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"ウィンドウ枠の固定","summary":"見出し行や列をスクロールしても表示し続ける機能。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0011"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"シート保護","summary":"セルの編集を制限する機能。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0012"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本用語","term":"エラー値","summary":"#DIV/0!（0で割った）、#N/A（見つからない）、#REF!（参照が無効）、#VALUE!（型が違う）、#NAME?（関数名が不正）。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0013"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"相対参照","summary":"数式をコピーすると参照先がずれる書き方（A1）。","examples":[{"code":"=A1*2","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0014"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"絶対参照","summary":"$を付けて参照先を固定する書き方（$A$1）。F4 キーで切り替え。","examples":[{"code":"=B2*$B$1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0015"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"複合参照","summary":"列だけ、または行だけを固定する書き方($A1, A$1)。","examples":[{"code":"=$A2*B$1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0016"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"他シートの参照","summary":"シート名!セル の形で別シートを参照します。","examples":[{"code":"=Sheet2!A1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0017"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"3D参照","summary":"複数シートの同じセルをまとめて参照する書き方。","examples":[{"code":"=SUM(Sheet1:Sheet3!A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0018"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"構造化参照","summary":"テーブルの列名を使った参照。","examples":[{"code":"=SUM(売上[金額])","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0019"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"名前の定義","summary":"セル範囲に名前を付けて数式で使える。","examples":[{"code":"=消費税率*A1","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0020"},{"lang":"excel","category":"参照方式","term":"スピル範囲 #","summary":"動的配列の結果範囲全体を指す記号。","examples":[{"code":"=SUM(A1#)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0021"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"SUM","summary":"合計を求める。","examples":[{"code":"=SUM(A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0022"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"AVERAGE","summary":"平均を求める。","examples":[{"code":"=AVERAGE(A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0023"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"COUNT","summary":"数値が入ったセルの個数。","examples":[{"code":"=COUNT(A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0024"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"COUNTA","summary":"空白でないセルの個数。","examples":[{"code":"=COUNTA(A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0025"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"COUNTBLANK","summary":"空白セルの個数。","examples":[{"code":"=COUNTBLANK(A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0026"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"MAX / MIN","summary":"最大値／最小値。","examples":[{"code":"=MAX(A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0027"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"LARGE / SMALL","summary":"大きい／小さい方から数えて n 番目の値。","examples":[{"code":"=LARGE(A1:A10,2)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0028"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"ROUND / ROUNDUP / ROUNDDOWN","summary":"四捨五入／切り上げ／切り捨て。","examples":[{"code":"=ROUND(A1,0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0029"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"INT / TRUNC","summary":"整数にする（小数を切り捨て）。","examples":[{"code":"=INT(3.7)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0030"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"MOD","summary":"割り算のあまり。","examples":[{"code":"=MOD(10,3)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0031"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"ABS","summary":"絶対値。","examples":[{"code":"=ABS(-5)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0032"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"RANK / RANK.EQ","summary":"順位を求める。","examples":[{"code":"=RANK.EQ(B2,$B$2:$B$10,0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0033"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"SUMPRODUCT","summary":"対応する値を掛けて合計する。条件付き合計にも使える。","examples":[{"code":"=SUMPRODUCT(A1:A5,B1:B5)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0034"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"RAND / RANDBETWEEN","summary":"乱数を作る。","examples":[{"code":"=RANDBETWEEN(1,6)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0035"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"SUBTOTAL","summary":"フィルターで表示されている行だけを集計。","examples":[{"code":"=SUBTOTAL(9,A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0036"},{"lang":"excel","category":"基本の関数","term":"AGGREGATE","summary":"エラーや非表示行を除いて集計できる。","examples":[{"code":"=AGGREGATE(9,6,A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0037"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"IF","summary":"条件で結果を切り替える。","examples":[{"code":"=IF(A1>=60,\"合格\",\"不合格\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0038"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"IFS","summary":"複数の条件を順に判定する。","examples":[{"code":"=IFS(A1>=80,\"A\",A1>=60,\"B\",TRUE,\"C\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0039"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"AND / OR / NOT","summary":"複数の条件を組み合わせる。","examples":[{"code":"=IF(AND(A1>0,B1>0),\"OK\",\"NG\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0040"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"IFERROR","summary":"エラーのときに別の値を表示する。","examples":[{"code":"=IFERROR(A1/B1,0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0041"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"IFNA","summary":"#N/A のときだけ別の値を表示する。","examples":[{"code":"=IFNA(VLOOKUP(...),\"なし\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0042"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"SWITCH","summary":"値に応じて結果を選ぶ。","examples":[{"code":"=SWITCH(A1,1,\"月\",2,\"火\",\"他\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0043"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"SUMIF","summary":"条件に合うセルの合計。","examples":[{"code":"=SUMIF(A:A,\"東京\",B:B)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0044"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"SUMIFS","summary":"複数条件に合うセルの合計。","examples":[{"code":"=SUMIFS(C:C,A:A,\"東京\",B:B,\">=100\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0045"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"COUNTIF","summary":"条件に合うセルの個数。","examples":[{"code":"=COUNTIF(A:A,\"東京\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0046"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"COUNTIFS","summary":"複数条件に合うセルの個数。","examples":[{"code":"=COUNTIFS(A:A,\"東京\",B:B,\">=50\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0047"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"AVERAGEIF(S)","summary":"条件に合う平均。","examples":[{"code":"=AVERAGEIF(A:A,\"東京\",B:B)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0048"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"MAXIFS / MINIFS","summary":"条件に合う最大／最小。","examples":[{"code":"=MAXIFS(B:B,A:A,\"東京\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0049"},{"lang":"excel","category":"条件付きの関数","term":"ワイルドカード","summary":"* は任意の文字列、? は任意の1文字。条件指定で使える。","examples":[{"code":"=COUNTIF(A:A,\"東*\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0050"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"VLOOKUP","summary":"表の左端列で探し、右側の列の値を返す。","examples":[{"code":"=VLOOKUP(A2,$E$2:$G$100,3,FALSE)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0051"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"HLOOKUP","summary":"表の上端行で探し、下側の行の値を返す。","examples":[{"code":"=HLOOKUP(A2,$A$1:$Z$3,2,FALSE)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0052"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"XLOOKUP","summary":"検索値を探して対応する値を返す。左右どちらの列でも探せ、見つからない場合の値も指定できる。","examples":[{"code":"=XLOOKUP(A2,E:E,G:G,\"なし\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0053"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"XMATCH","summary":"検索値の位置を返す新しい関数。","examples":[{"code":"=XMATCH(A2,E:E)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0054"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"INDEX","summary":"範囲の中の指定位置の値を返す。","examples":[{"code":"=INDEX(A1:C10,3,2)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0055"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"MATCH","summary":"検索値が範囲の何番目かを返す。","examples":[{"code":"=MATCH(\"東京\",A1:A10,0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0056"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"INDEX + MATCH","summary":"柔軟な検索の定番の組み合わせ。","examples":[{"code":"=INDEX(C:C,MATCH(A2,A:A,0))","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0057"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"OFFSET","summary":"基準セルからずらした位置を参照する。","examples":[{"code":"=OFFSET(A1,2,1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0058"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"INDIRECT","summary":"文字列をセル参照として扱う。","examples":[{"code":"=INDIRECT(\"A\"&ROW())","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0059"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"CHOOSE","summary":"番号で選択肢を選ぶ。","examples":[{"code":"=CHOOSE(2,\"赤\",\"青\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0060"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"ROW / COLUMN","summary":"行番号／列番号。","examples":[{"code":"=ROW()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0061"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"ROWS / COLUMNS","summary":"範囲の行数／列数。","examples":[{"code":"=ROWS(A1:A10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0062"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"LOOKUP","summary":"昇順に並んだ範囲から近い値を探す。","examples":[{"code":"=LOOKUP(85,{0,60,80},{\"C\",\"B\",\"A\"})","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0063"},{"lang":"excel","category":"検索と参照","term":"HYPERLINK","summary":"クリックで開くリンクを作る。","examples":[{"code":"=HYPERLINK(\"https://example.com\",\"開く\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0064"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"LEFT / RIGHT / MID","summary":"文字列の先頭／末尾／途中を取り出す。","examples":[{"code":"=MID(A1,2,3)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0065"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"LEN","summary":"文字数。","examples":[{"code":"=LEN(A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0066"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"FIND / SEARCH","summary":"文字の位置を探す。SEARCH は大文字小文字を区別しない。","examples":[{"code":"=FIND(\"-\",A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0067"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"SUBSTITUTE","summary":"文字列を置換する。","examples":[{"code":"=SUBSTITUTE(A1,\"-\",\"\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0068"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"REPLACE","summary":"位置と長さを指定して置換。","examples":[{"code":"=REPLACE(A1,1,2,\"**\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0069"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"TRIM","summary":"余分な空白を取り除く。","examples":[{"code":"=TRIM(A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0070"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"CONCAT / TEXTJOIN","summary":"文字列をつなげる。TEXTJOIN は区切り文字を指定できる。","examples":[{"code":"=TEXTJOIN(\",\",TRUE,A1:A5)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0071"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"& 演算子","summary":"文字列をつなぐ。","examples":[{"code":"=A1&\"様\"","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0072"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"TEXT","summary":"数値や日付を書式付き文字列にする。","examples":[{"code":"=TEXT(A1,\"yyyy/mm/dd\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0073"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"VALUE","summary":"文字列を数値に変える。","examples":[{"code":"=VALUE(\"123\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0074"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"UPPER / LOWER / PROPER","summary":"大文字／小文字／語頭だけ大文字。","examples":[{"code":"=UPPER(A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0075"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"ASC / JIS","summary":"全角を半角／半角を全角に変換。","examples":[{"code":"=JIS(A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0076"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"PHONETIC","summary":"漢字のふりがなを表示。","examples":[{"code":"=PHONETIC(A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0077"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"TEXTSPLIT","summary":"区切り文字で分割して複数のセルに展開する。","examples":[{"code":"=TEXTSPLIT(A1,\",\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0078"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"TEXTBEFORE / TEXTAFTER","summary":"区切り文字の前／後の文字を取り出す。","examples":[{"code":"=TEXTBEFORE(A1,\"@\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0079"},{"lang":"excel","category":"文字列の関数","term":"CHAR / CODE / UNICHAR","summary":"文字コードと文字の変換。","examples":[{"code":"=CHAR(10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0080"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"TODAY / NOW","summary":"今日の日付／現在の日時。","examples":[{"code":"=TODAY()","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0081"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"DATE","summary":"年・月・日から日付を作る。","examples":[{"code":"=DATE(2026,11,6)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0082"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"YEAR / MONTH / DAY","summary":"日付から年・月・日を取り出す。","examples":[{"code":"=MONTH(A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0083"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"WEEKDAY","summary":"曜日の番号。","examples":[{"code":"=WEEKDAY(A1,2)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0084"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"EDATE / EOMONTH","summary":"n か月後の日付／月末日。","examples":[{"code":"=EOMONTH(A1,0)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0085"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"DATEDIF","summary":"2つの日付の差を年・月・日で求める。","examples":[{"code":"=DATEDIF(A1,B1,\"Y\")","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0086"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"NETWORKDAYS","summary":"土日祝を除いた営業日数。","examples":[{"code":"=NETWORKDAYS(A1,B1,休日一覧)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0087"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"WORKDAY","summary":"営業日を足した日付。","examples":[{"code":"=WORKDAY(A1,10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0088"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"TIME / HOUR / MINUTE","summary":"時刻の作成と取り出し。","examples":[{"code":"=HOUR(A1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0089"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"シリアル値","summary":"日付を数値で扱う仕組み。1900/1/1 が 1。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0090"},{"lang":"excel","category":"日付と時刻","term":"時間の表示 [h]:mm","summary":"24時間を超える時間を表示する書式。","examples":[],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0091"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"FILTER","summary":"条件に合う行を抽出する。","examples":[{"code":"=FILTER(A2:C100,B2:B100>=50)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0092"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"SORT / SORTBY","summary":"並べ替えた結果を返す。","examples":[{"code":"=SORT(A2:B100,2,-1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0093"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"UNIQUE","summary":"重複を除いた一覧を返す。","examples":[{"code":"=UNIQUE(A2:A100)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0094"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"SEQUENCE","summary":"連続した数値の配列を作る。","examples":[{"code":"=SEQUENCE(10)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0095"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"LET","summary":"計算の途中結果に名前を付けて、数式を読みやすく速くする。","examples":[{"code":"=LET(x,A1*2,x+1)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0096"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"LAMBDA","summary":"自作の関数を作る。","examples":[{"code":"=LAMBDA(x,x*2)(5)","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0097"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"MAP / REDUCE / SCAN","summary":"配列の各要素に処理を適用する関数。","examples":[{"code":"=MAP(A1:A5,LAMBDA(x,x*2))","note":""}],"pages":[],"id":"excel-0098"},{"lang":"excel","category":"動的配列関数","term":"TAKE / DROP","summary":"配列の先頭・末尾から取り出す／除く。","examples":[{"code":"=TAKE(A1:C10,3)","note":""